yle="height: auto; opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="contents"><div data-is-streaming="false" class="group relative relative pb-3" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><h2 class="sr-only select-none">Claude responded: Let me give you a clear recap of everything you've built, then guide you to run it in VS Code.</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Let me give you a clear recap of everything you've built, then guide you to run it in VS Code.</p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">What You Built 🏗️</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>You created a full AI-based Credit Card Fraud Detection System with 4 main components:</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>1. ML Pipeline</strong> (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">fraud-ml/</code>)</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Loaded real banking fraud dataset (284,807 transactions)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Engineered features: transaction velocity, amount patterns, time-of-day signals</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Trained a Gradient Boosting model (ROC-AUC &gt; 0.97)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Built explainability layer returning human-readable fraud reasons</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Saved model as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">gradient_boosting_fraud_model.pkl</code></li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>2. FastAPI Backend</strong> (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">fraud-backend/</code>)</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">REST API with <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">/fraud/check</code> endpoint</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Pydantic schema validation</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">CORS middleware (allows frontend to call it)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">In-memory sliding window rate limiter (blocks after 5 requests/10 seconds → HTTP 429)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Returns: risk score + decision + explanation</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>3. Next.js Frontend</strong> (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">fraud-frontend/</code>)</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Transaction input form</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Visual risk gauge (green/yellow/red bar)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Decision badge (APPROVE / STEP_UP_AUTH / BLOCK)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Explanation list</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">"Simulate Card-Testing Attack" button that triggers the rate limiter</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>4. Inference Module</strong> (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">fraud-ml/inference/fraud_inference.py</code>)</p>
