<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">While Waiting — Also Do This Manually</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Open <strong>Settings → System → Storage</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Temporary files"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Check everything and click <strong>"Remove files"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Also check <strong>"Storage Sense"</strong> and run it</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
