<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Meanwhile — Check These Manually</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Open <strong>File Explorer</strong> and check sizes of these folders:</p>
