</span><span>        ↓
</span><span>ML Inference runs for valid requests
</span><span>        ↓
</span><span>Returns JSON:
</span><span>{
</span><span>  "risk_score": 0.78,
</span><span>  "decision": "BLOCK",
</span><span>  "explanation": ["Night transaction", "High velocity"]
</span><span>}</span></code></pre></div></div>
