<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">threshold.json</code> — The Decision Boundary</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Contains just one number: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">0.3</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">The model outputs a probability between 0 and 1</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">We need a cutoff point to say "above this = fraud"</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>What's inside:</strong></p>
