</span></span><span>        ↓
</span><span>Step 2: Engineer new features
</span><span>        - amount_log = log(amount) → handles large amounts
</span><span>        - tx_count_1min = how many transactions in last 1 min
</span><span>        - hour = what time of day
</span><span>        - is_night = is it between midnight and 5am?
</span><span>        ↓
</span><span>Step 3: Split data
</span><span>        - First 80% = training (227,845 rows) → model learns from this
</span><span>        - Last 20% = testing (56,962 rows) → we check accuracy here
</span><span>        ↓
</span><span>Step 4: Handle imbalance
</span><span>        - Only 417 fraud in 227,845 rows
</span><span>        - Give fraud cases 545x more importance
</span><span>        - Forces model to take fraud seriously
</span><span>        ↓
</span><span>Step 5: Train Gradient Boosting model
</span><span>        - 200 decision trees working together
</span><span>        - Each tree learns from previous tree's mistakes
</span><span>        ↓
</span><span>Step 6: Evaluate
</span><span>        - ROC-AUC: 0.9850 (excellent)
</span><span>        - Recall: 85.33% (catches 64/75 frauds)
</span><span>        ↓
</span><span>Step 7: Save model, feature list, threshold to models/</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Analogy:</strong> Like a medical school that trains a doctor (2 minutes), then the doctor graduates and is ready to diagnose patients forever.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">📄 <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">fraud_inference.py</code> — The Doctor on Duty</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>What it does:</strong> Loads the saved model and scores ANY new transaction instantly.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>This runs every time</strong> a transaction needs to be checked.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Three functions inside:</strong></p>
