</span></span><span><span>  </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 0);">"Unusually high transaction amount"</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">]</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Analogy:</strong> The trained doctor (model) is now on duty 24/7. Every time a patient (transaction) walks in, the doctor checks vitals (features), gives a diagnosis (risk score), prescribes action (approve/block), and writes notes (explanation).</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">📄 <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">main.py</code> — The Security Gate + Reception</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>What it does:</strong> Creates an API that the dashboard talks to. Also enforces the rate limiter.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Two main jobs:</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Job 1 — Rate Limiter (Security Gate)</strong></p>
