<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Analogy:</strong> A bank branch entrance. The security guard (rate limiter) checks if you've entered too many times recently. If OK, the receptionist (API) takes your request, processes it, and gives you an answer.</p>
