<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Analogy:</strong> A clean workshop with only the tools needed for this project. You activate it (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.\venv\Scripts\activate</code>) when you enter the workshop, and deactivate when you leave. Other projects have their own workshops.</p>
