<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Now let's make some requests so the counters fill up. Go to <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="http://localhost:8501/">http://localhost:8501</a></strong> (Streamlit dashboard) and:</p>
