</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Then come back and check <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="http://localhost:8000/health">http://localhost:8000/health</a></strong> again — you'll see real numbers!</p>
