]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Sure! Let me explain every single part of Phase 3 clearly.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">🧠 What is Phase 3 About?</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Phase 3 adds <strong>Observability</strong> to your system.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Observability</strong> means: <em>"Can I see exactly what my system is doing at any moment?"</em></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-pre-wrap">Without observability → you're flying blind
With observability → you see every request, every decision, every problem</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Real companies like Google, Stripe, and Visa have entire teams dedicated to this.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">📝 Feature 1 — Structured JSON Logging</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">What it is</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Every single transaction is written to a log file as JSON.</p>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Why JSON and not plain text?</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Plain text log (bad):</strong></p>
