me</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">.</span><span>time</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">(</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">)</span><span>           </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(110, 118, 135);"># recorded when server starts</span><span>
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(110, 118, 135);"># Later when /health is called:</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>uptime_seconds </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">=</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(179, 74, 0);">int</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">(</span><span>time</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">.</span><span>time</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">(</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">)</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">-</span><span> START_TIME</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">)</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(110, 118, 135);"># Convert to human readable: "0h 5m 23s"</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">Why companies use this</h4>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Load balancers ping <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">/health</code> every 30 seconds</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">If it returns anything other than <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">"status": "ok"</code> → server removed from pool</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Kubernetes uses this for automatic restart</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">On-call engineers check this first when something is wrong</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">📈 Feature 5 — <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">/metrics</code> Endpoint</h3>
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">What it is</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Calculates <strong>percentage-based metrics</strong> from the raw counters.</p>
