</span></span><span>      ↓
</span><span>Generate unique request_id ("7d9631dc")
</span><span>      ↓
</span><span>Record start_time
</span><span>      ↓
</span><span>Rate limit check (Redis)
</span><span>  ├── Blocked? → log "rate_limited" event → return 429
</span><span>  └── OK? → continue
</span><span>      ↓
</span><span>ML inference runs
</span><span>      ↓
</span><span>Decision made (APPROVE/STEP_UP/BLOCK)
</span><span>      ↓
</span><span>Update stats counters
</span><span>      ↓
</span><span>Calculate latency_ms
</span><span>      ↓
</span><span>Log "transaction_scored" event to file + terminal
</span><span>      ↓
</span><span>Return response with request_id + latency_ms</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
