<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Why <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">requirements.txt</code> Matters</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">It tells anyone (or any server) exactly what packages to install to run your project. Without it, nobody can reproduce your environment.</p>
