</span></span><span>Card B ──→ Merchant X ──→ IP 192.168.1.1
</span><span>Card C ──→ Merchant X ──→ IP 192.168.1.1</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">If 3 different cards all use the same merchant AND same IP → <strong>fraud ring detected</strong>.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">No single transaction looks suspicious alone. But the graph reveals the pattern.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
