<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">🎯 60-Second Project Pitch (Memorize This)</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">"I built a production-grade AI Credit Card Fraud Detection System from scratch. It has four layers working together — a Redis-backed distributed rate limiter that blocks card-testing attacks before ML runs, a Gradient Boosting model trained on 284,807 real transactions achieving ROC-AUC of 0.9850, a graph-based fraud detector using NetworkX that identifies fraud rings by analyzing card-merchant-IP relationships in real time, and a Streamlit dashboard with live metrics. The system handles 6,400+ requests per minute with sub-10ms inference latency and zero errors under concurrent load."</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">🏗️ System Architecture (Draw This on Whiteboard)</h3>
