,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Great thinking! This is exactly what separates a demo project from a production-grade system.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Here's the full plan:</p>
