>c </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 0);">"import os; print('CPU cores:', os.cpu_count())"</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Paste the output and I'll configure the optimal worker count for your machine.</p>
