<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>When it says "Press Enter when Redis is stopped":</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click on <strong>Terminal 1</strong> (Redis terminal)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Press <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Ctrl+C</code> there to stop Redis</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click back on <strong>Terminal 3</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Press just <strong>Enter</strong> (nothing else)</li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>When it says "Press Enter when Redis is back":</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click on <strong>Terminal 1</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Run <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">D:\Redis\redis-server.exe</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click back on <strong>Terminal 3</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Press just <strong>Enter</strong></li>
</ol>
