<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">What Each Phase Proved</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Before chaos:</strong> Redis up, all 5 requests processed normally.</p>
