<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">The difference is:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>GMap</strong> works on GitHub Pages because it's pure HTML/JavaScript — runs in the browser with no server needed</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Fraud Detection</strong> needs a running Python server (FastAPI + Streamlit) — can't run on GitHub Pages</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Best Free Option — Streamlit Cloud</h3>
