<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">The Challenge</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Streamlit Cloud can host the dashboard but it needs the trained model to exist. Since <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">creditcard.csv</code> is too large for GitHub, we need a workaround.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Solution: Include the pre-trained model in the repo</strong> (it's only ~5MB, well within GitHub limits).</p>
