<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">The Catch</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Streamlit Cloud is free but:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">No Redis (rate limiter falls back to in-memory — still works)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">No persistent graph (resets on each session — still works for demo)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Cold start takes ~30 seconds first time</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Everything still works — just without Redis.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">My Recommendation</h3>
