<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Fix — Make App Public</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://share.streamlit.io/">https://share.streamlit.io</a></strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Sign in with GitHub</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Find your app <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">fraud-detection-manoj</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click the <strong>three dots (⋯)</strong> next to it</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Settings"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Under <strong>"Sharing"</strong> — set to <strong>"Public"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Save</li>
</ol>
