3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">I can see the download options. Also I notice your <strong>Streamlit app is already showing in the browser tab</strong> — "rmanojgowda's apps · Streamlit" is open!</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Two Things:</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>1. For Docker — Click:</strong>
<strong>"Download for Windows — AMD64"</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Save it to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">D:\</code></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>2. Check Streamlit First — It Might Be Live Already!</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">I can see the Streamlit tab is open. Click on that tab and tell me what you see — your app might already be running!</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">👉 Also check: <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://fraud-detection-manoj.streamlit.app/">https://fraud-detection-manoj.streamlit.app</a></strong></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">While Docker Downloads</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Your machine is Windows 64-bit (AMD64) so that's the correct version.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Once downloaded, run in PowerShell:</p>
