<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Now let's install GCP CLI and deploy.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 1 — Install GCP CLI</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Download from:
👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://cloud.google.com/sdk/docs/install-sdk#windows">https://cloud.google.com/sdk/docs/install-sdk#windows</a></strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Click <strong>"Windows"</strong> → Download the installer</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Save to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">D:\</code> and run it. During installation:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Change install path to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">D:\GoogleCloudSDK</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Check "Add to PATH"</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 2 — Do You Have a Google Account?</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">We need a GCP account. Go to:
👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://console.cloud.google.com/">https://console.cloud.google.com</a></strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Sign in with your Google account. New accounts get <strong>$300 free credits</strong>.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">While Downloading GCP CLI — Create Dockerfile</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Create a new file <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">D:\fraud-detection\Dockerfile</code> in VS Code with this content:</p>
