n>version</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">If it works → great, we continue with GCP deployment!</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">If not → we'll install gcloud differently using Python (which is already on D: drive).</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Alternative If gcloud Failed</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">We can use the <strong>Python-based install</strong> which goes entirely to D: drive:</p>
