<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">It's right next to the search bar, between the notification bell and your profile picture.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step by Step</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://console.cloud.google.com/">https://console.cloud.google.com</a></strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Make sure you're signed in</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Look at the <strong>top right toolbar</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click the <strong><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">&gt;_</code> icon</strong> (it looks like a terminal/command prompt)</li>
</ol>
