&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">You need to create a billing account. Click <strong>"Create account"</strong> or <strong>"Add billing account"</strong> button on that page.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step by Step</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">On the billing page, click <strong>"Create account"</strong> or <strong>"+ Create Billing Account"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Fill in:
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Country: <strong>India</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Currency: <strong>INR</strong></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Continue</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Enter your <strong>debit/credit card details</strong>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">You get <strong>$300 free credits</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">You <strong>won't be charged</strong> unless you manually upgrade</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Start my free trial</strong></li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Don't Have a Card?</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">If you don't want to add a card, there's a free alternative:</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Use Google Cloud's "Always Free" tier with App Engine</strong> instead of Cloud Run — it doesn't require billing for basic deployments.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Or we can skip GCP entirely since you already have:</p>
<div role="group" aria-label="Code" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button class="inline-flex
