</span></span><span>✅ Live Demo: https://ai-fraud-detection-rmanojgowda.streamlit.app</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">That's already sufficient for your resume and interviews.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">My Honest Advice</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">The Streamlit live demo is <strong>already working and impressive</strong>. GCP adds "deployed on Google Cloud" to your resume but the core value is already there.</p>
