</span><span>            hour, is_night
</span><span>
</span><span>Problem:    Class imbalance (545x more normal than fraud)
</span><span>Solution:   Sample weights (fraud gets 545x more importance)
</span><span>Threshold:  0.3 (catches more fraud than default 0.5)
</span><span>
</span><span>Results:
</span><span>  ROC-AUC:        0.9850
</span><span>  Fraud Recall:   85.33% (64/75 frauds caught)
</span><span>  Missed frauds:  only 11 out of 56,962 test transactions
