</span></span><span><span>df</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">[</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 0);">"is_night"</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">]</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">=</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 0, 194);">if</span><span> hour </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">&lt;</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">5</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(129, 0, 194);">else</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Why: Fraud happens more at night when victims are asleep and banks have less staff monitoring.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
