<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-pre-wrap">If you train a model on this raw data it learns:
"Just predict normal every time → 99.83% accuracy!"</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">This is called the <strong>majority class problem</strong>. We fixed it with <strong>sample weights</strong>:</p>
