<span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">284315</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">/</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">492</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">=</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">578</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>sample_weights </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">=</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">{</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">:</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">,</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">:</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">578</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">}</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>model</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">.</span><span>fit</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">(</span><span>X_train</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">,</span><span> y_train</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">,</span><span> sample_weight</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">=</span><span>sample_weights</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">)</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">This tells the model: "Every fraud case is 578 times more important than a normal case. If you miss a fraud, you're penalized 578x harder."</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">The Model — Gradient Boosting</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">We chose Gradient Boosting over other models. Here's why:</p>
<div role="group" aria-label="Code" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button class="inline-flex
