</span></span><span>Recall:   85.33%  ← catches 64 out of 75 fraud cases
</span><span>Precision: ~93%   ← when it says fraud, it's usually right
</span><span>Missed:   11 frauds out of 56,962 test transactions</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>What ROC-AUC means:</strong> If you show the model one fraud and one normal transaction, it ranks the fraud higher 98.5% of the time.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Interview Answer for Phase 1</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><em>"I trained a Gradient Boosting model on 284,807 real bank transactions with 0.17% fraud rate. The main challenge was class imbalance — I applied 545x sample weights to force the model to take fraud seriously. I also engineered velocity features (transaction counts over 1, 10, 60 minute windows) and time-of-day signals, then tuned the threshold to 0.3 to maximize recall. The model achieves ROC-AUC of 0.9850, catching 85% of fraud cases."</em></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold">🔌 Phase 2 — FastAPI Backend</h2>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">What Is FastAPI?</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">FastAPI is a Python web framework for building APIs. Think of it as a waiter in a restaurant:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Customer (frontend) gives order (request)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Waiter (FastAPI) takes it to the kitchen (ML model)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Kitchen prepares the food (inference)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Waiter brings it back (response)</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Why FastAPI Over Flask or Django?</h3>
