</span></span><span>  + Simple
</span><span>  - No automatic validation
</span><span>  - No automatic documentation
</span><span>  - Slower
</span><span>
</span><span>Django:
</span><span>  + Full featured
</span><span>  - Too heavy for a single API
</span><span>  - Overkill
</span><span>
</span><span>FastAPI:
</span><span>  + Automatic request validation ✅
</span><span>  + Automatic Swagger documentation ✅
</span><span>  + Type hints → fewer bugs ✅
</span><span>  + Very fast (async support) ✅
</span><span>  + Used at Netflix, Uber, Microsoft ✅</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
