</span></span><span>Server 2: User has made 0 requests → 5 more allowed (thinks it's new)
</span><span>
</span><span>Attacker hits Server 1 once, then Server 2 five times
</span><span>= 6 requests total, rate limit bypassed!</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Redis solution:</strong></p>
