</span></span><span>Server 2 checks Redis: "User has made 5 requests" → BLOCKED
</span><span>
</span><span>Redis is shared memory across ALL servers</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">The Sliding Window Algorithm</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">We use a <strong>sorted set</strong> in Redis. Each member is a timestamp, the score is also that timestamp.</p>
