<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Interview Answer for Phase 3</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><em>"I implemented a sliding window rate limiter using Redis sorted sets. Each IP address has a Redis key containing timestamps of recent requests. On each request, I remove timestamps outside the 10-second window, count remaining, and block if count exceeds 5. I use Redis pipelines for atomic execution to prevent race conditions. The system gracefully falls back to in-memory limiting if Redis is unavailable, which I verified through chaos testing."</em></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
