<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold">🧠 Why V1-V28? — Complete Explanation</h2>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">The Real-World Problem</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Imagine you work at a bank and want to share transaction data with researchers to build fraud detection. The data looks like this:</p>
