<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">What Is CORS?</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">CORS = Cross-Origin Resource Sharing</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Origin</strong> = protocol + domain + port</p>
