</span></span><span>FastAPI Backend:     http://localhost:8000
</span><span>
</span><span>Different ports = different origins = BLOCKED by browser!
</span><span>
</span><span>Without CORS:
</span><span>  Browser: "localhost:8501 is trying to call localhost:8000"
</span><span>  Browser: "Different origin — BLOCKED for security"
</span><span>  Error: "Access to fetch at 'localhost:8000' from origin 
</span><span>          'localhost:8501' has been blocked by CORS policy"</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
