</span></span><span>   "Hey API, can localhost:8501 call you?"
</span><span>
</span><span>2. FastAPI (with CORS middleware) responds:
</span><span>   "Yes, all origins allowed"
</span><span>   Header: "Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *"
</span><span>
</span><span>3. Browser now allows the actual request
</span><span>4. Streamlit gets the fraud detection response</span></code></pre></div></div>
