</span></span><span>Rate limit check:   ~1ms   (Redis network call)
</span><span>ML inference:       ~10ms  (model prediction)
</span><span>
</span><span>Total valid request:   ~11ms
</span><span>Total invalid request: ~0.1ms (Pydantic rejects)
</span><span>Total rate-limited:    ~1ms   (Redis blocks)
</span><span>
</span><span>We never waste 10ms on ML for invalid or abusive requests</span></code></pre></div></div>
