<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Why We're Reverting — The Honest Interview Answer</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">This is actually a <strong>stronger interview story</strong> than pretending recall is 85%:</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><em>"I tried SMOTE oversampling to improve recall from 76% to 85%, but it actually reduced ROC-AUC from 0.9883 to 0.9732. Investigation showed the 18 missed frauds score below 0.30 — they're genuinely ambiguous cases that look identical to normal transactions in the feature space. SMOTE's synthetic examples didn't help because the problem isn't data quantity — it's that these specific transactions have no distinguishing signal in V1-V28. In production, the graph layer and human review would catch some of these. This taught me that more data doesn't always help — sometimes the signal genuinely isn't there."</em></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">That answer shows senior-level thinking. Run the training and paste output! 🚀</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"><div class="group/artifact-block relative flex text-left font-ui rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-0.5 transition duration-300 w-full hover:bg-bg-000/50 px-4 border-border-300 hover:border-border-200"><button type="button" class="absolute inset-0 cursor-pointer rounded-[inherit] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-accent-200" aria-label="View Train model"></button><div class="artifact-block-cell flex flex-1 align-start justify-between w-full"><div class="flex flex-1 gap-2 min-w-0"><div class="flex items-end w-[68px] relative shrink-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"><div class="absolute right-2 flex flex-1 overflow-hidden w-[52px] h-[71px] rounded-t-lg border-0.5 border-border-200 select-none scale-[1] group-hover/artifact-block:scale-[1.035] -rotate-[0.1rad] group-hover/artifact-block:-rotate-[0.065rad] duration-300 ease-out group-hover/artifact-block:duration-400 group-hover/artifact-block:ease-[cubic-bezier(0,0.9,0.5,1.35)] transition-transform backface-hidden will-change-transform translate-y-[19%] bg-gradient-to-b from-bg-000 to-bg-000/0 pt-4 items-start justify-center h-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="text-text-500"><path d="M212.24,83.76l-56-56A6,6,0,0,0,152,26H56A14,14,0,0,0,42,40V216a14,14,0,0,0,14,14H200a14,14,0,0,0,14-14V88A6,6,0,0,0,212.24,83.76ZM158,46.48,193.52,82H158ZM200,218H56a2,2,0,0,1-2-2V40a2,2,0,0,1,2-2h90V88a6,6,0,0,0,6,6h50V216A2,2,0,0,1,200,218Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-4 min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="leading-tight text-sm line-clamp-1">Train model</div><div class="text-xs line-clamp-1 text-text-400 opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-200">PY&nbsp;</div></div></div