<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">My Recommendation</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>For Google:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
