rkdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Let me walk you through the complete journey — from zero to production.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold">🚀 The Beginning — Why This Project?</h2>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">You're a 2026 B.E. ISE graduate from Siddaganga Institute of Technology targeting SDE 1 roles at Google, Razorpay, Stripe, and Flipkart. Most graduates apply with todo apps or college assignments. You needed something that screams <strong>production-grade engineering</strong>.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">We chose <strong>AI Credit Card Fraud Detection</strong> because:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">It's directly relevant to fintech companies (Razorpay, Stripe, PhonePe)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">It combines ML + backend + distributed systems in one project</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">It has real business stakes — fraud costs banks billions annually</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">It's deployable as a live demo anyone can click</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold">🔧 Environment Setup — The First Problem</h2>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>The problem:</strong> Your C: drive had <strong>0 bytes free</strong>. Nothing could install. Python packages failed. WSL broke.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>The solution:</strong> Found D: drive with 125GB free and redirected everything:</p>
<div role="group" aria-label="Code" tabindex="0" class="relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent-100"><div class="sticky opacity-0 group-hover/copy:opacity-100 group-focus-within/copy:opacity-100 top-2 py-2 h-12 w-0 float-right"><div class="absolute right-0 h-8 px-2 items-center inline-flex z-10"><button class="inline-flex
