<span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">284315</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">/</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">492</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">=</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">545</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(110, 118, 135);"># Tell the model: every fraud case is 545x more important</span><span>
</span></span><span><span>sample_weight </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(20, 24, 31);">=</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">{</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">:</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">,</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">:</span><span> </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">545</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(43, 48, 59);">}</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Feature engineering — 8 initial features:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">V1-V28 (PCA-anonymized bank features)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Amount</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Hour of day, is_night flag</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Transaction velocity (1min, 10min, 60min windows)</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Why V1-V28?</strong> Banks can't share raw data — card numbers, merchant names, locations violate privacy laws. They run PCA (Principal Component Analysis) which mathematically scrambles the original features into V1-V28. The fraud signal is preserved but personal data is unrecoverable. Real fraud engineers at Visa and Mastercard work with exactly these features.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>First results (sklearn Gradient Boosting):</strong></p>
