<h2 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold">🔒 Phase 9 — Graph Hardening</h2>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Gap 1 found:</strong> Edges never expired. A fraud ring from last week still flags new transactions. Fraudsters spacing attacks over time bypass detection.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Fix:</strong> 1-hour TTL on all edges + background cleanup thread every 5 minutes.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Gap 2 found:</strong> IP rotation bypass. If each card uses a different IP, the graph never connects them.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Fix:</strong> Merchant-based ring detection:</p>
