<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Part 1 — Fix the LightGBM Recall</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">The recall dropped 85.33% → 76% after LightGBM. We tried SMOTE and it didn't help. There's one more approach we haven't tried — <strong>tuning LightGBM hyperparameters specifically for recall</strong>.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">The key parameters that control recall in LightGBM:</p>
