<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Direct link: 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-31020/">https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-31020/</a></strong></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Install Instructions</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">When installer opens:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Do NOT check</strong> "Add Python to PATH"</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Customize installation"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Next</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Change install location</strong> to: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">D:\Python310</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Install</strong></li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">While Downloading</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Let me prepare the venv fix command so it's ready the moment Python installs:</p>
