<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Go to 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://aka.ms/vs/17/release/vc_redist.x64.exe">https://aka.ms/vs/17/release/vc_redist.x64.exe</a></strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">This will auto-download the Visual C++ 2022 Redistributable. Run it and click <strong>Install</strong>.</p>
