</span><span>  That's a 20x gap in scores!</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">To catch the missed frauds you'd need threshold ≈ 0.036. But then you'd also flag thousands of normal transactions scoring between 0.036 and 0.772.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Look at the missed fraud characteristics:</strong></p>
