</span></span><span>Hour:   16, 17, 18, 19, 20          ← afternoon/evening
</span><span>Score:  0.000005 to 0.036           ← model is confident these are NORMAL</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">These frauds look EXACTLY like legitimate small transactions — afternoon purchases of ₹1-7. Even a human analyst would likely approve them.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
