  Missed frauds have V14 ~ -1.7 (close to normal!)
  Normal txns have  V14 ~ -0.123
Score distribution:
  Missed frauds score range: 0.000005 to 0.036322
  Caught frauds score range: 0.772216 to 0.999999
  Gap between groups: 0.736
Missed fraud amounts:
  Min: 0.00
  Max: 1096.99
  Mean: 146.57
  Most are small afternoon transactions (looks normal)
Conclusion:
  Missed frauds have V14 values SIMILAR to normal transactions.
  The bank's PCA encoding doesn't distinguish them.
  No ML model can reliably catch these without more data.
  This is a DATASET limitation, not a modeling limitation.
