</span></span><span>    ↓ depends on
</span><span>msvcp140.dll + vcruntime140.dll
</span><span>    ↓ provided by
</span><span>Visual C++ 2015-2022 Redistributable</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Your system was missing those runtime files — that's why it said "Could not find module" even though the DLL existed.</p>
