<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Why We Switched</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">The main reason was <strong>false positives</strong> — sklearn was blocking 395 legitimate customers per test window. That's unacceptable in production.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
