</span></span><span>────────────────────────────────────────────────────
</span><span>Visa/Mastercard  Ensemble (5-10)  Can afford complexity,
</span><span>                                  every missed fraud = millions
</span><span>                                  
</span><span>Razorpay/PhonePe Single model     Speed matters more,
</span><span>                                  latency budget is tight,
</span><span>                                  ensemble adds 10-20ms
</span><span>                                  
</span><span>Stripe           Ensemble (2-3)   Balance between accuracy
</span><span>                                  and latency
</span><span>                                  
</span><span>Small fintech    Single model     Simpler to maintain,
</span><span>                                  debug, and explain to auditors</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Latency Impact</h3>
