<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">sklearn GradientBoostingClassifier vs LightGBM</h3>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h4 class="text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold">How They Both Work (Same Foundation)</h4>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Both are <strong>Gradient Boosting</strong> — they build trees sequentially where each tree fixes the mistakes of the previous one:</p>
