</span></span><span>         Root
</span><span>        /    \
</span><span>      L1      R1        ← Level 1 (all nodes grown)
</span><span>     /  \    /  \
</span><span>   L2   R2  L3   R3    ← Level 2 (all nodes grown)
</span><span>
</span><span>More balanced, less overfitting
</span><span>Misses subtle deep patterns</span></code></pre></div></div>
