</span></span><span>         Root
</span><span>        /    \
</span><span>      L1      R1
</span><span>     /  \
</span><span>   L2   R2
</span><span>   /
</span><span>  L3                   ← Keeps splitting the best leaf
</span><span>
</span><span>Finds more complex patterns
</span><span>Can overfit on small data
</span><span>Faster (skips useless splits)</span></code></pre></div></div>
