<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>sklearn caught more fraud because:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Level-wise growth is more conservative</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">With high sample_weight (545x), it aggressively learns ALL fraud patterns</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Including the 18 "subtle" frauds with V14 = -1.7</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">But also flagged 395 normal transactions (too aggressive)</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>LightGBM missed more fraud because:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Leaf-wise growth is more precise</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">It learned the STRONG fraud patterns (V14 &lt; -5) very well</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Ignored the WEAK patterns (V14 = -1.7, looks normal)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Only flagged 4 false alarms (very precise)</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
