</span><span>
</span><span>Consumer app (Razorpay)     LightGBM         Can't block customers,
</span><span>                                             false alarms = churn
</span><span>
</span><span>High-value transactions     Ensemble         Both models vote,
</span><span>(&gt;₹50,000)                                  accuracy critical
</span><span>
