</span><span>(&lt;₹1,000)                                   more important
</span><span>
</span><span>Real-time (&lt;5ms budget)     LightGBM         sklearn too slow
</span><span>
</span><span>Batch processing            sklearn GBM      Speed doesn't matter
</span><span>(end of day)                                 recall does</span></code></pre></div></div>
