</span><span>That means blocking 255-425 extra legitimate customers
</span><span>to catch 7-8 more frauds.
</span><span>
</span><span>Cost calculation:
</span><span>  7 extra frauds caught  = 7 × ₹10,999 = ₹76,993 saved
</span><span>  260 extra false alarms = 260 × ₹900  = ₹234,000 cost
</span><span>
</span><span>NET RESULT: Ensemble COSTS ₹157,007 MORE than LightGBM alone!</span></code></pre></div></div>
