</span></span><span>  ✅ LightGBM only — best business decision
</span><span>
</span><span>For internal bank fraud team (human review available):
</span><span>  ✅ sklearn only — maximize recall, humans handle false alarms
</span><span>
</span><span>For our portfolio project:
</span><span>  ✅ LightGBM only + honest explanation</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Your Perfect Interview Answer Now</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><em>"I tested 7 ensemble combinations of sklearn GBM and LightGBM. sklearn alone gives 85.3% recall but 430 false positives. LightGBM alone gives 74.7% recall with only 5 false positives. The 70/30 ensemble reaches 82.7% recall but FP jumps to 176. Cost analysis shows the ensemble costs ₹157,000 more per test window than LightGBM alone — the extra false alarms outweigh the fraud savings. We chose LightGBM because for a consumer-facing payment system, blocking 430 legitimate customers is unacceptable. The 18 missed frauds have V14 values indistinguishable from normal transactions — a dataset limitation no model can overcome."</em></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Decision: Keep LightGBM ✅</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">The investigation is complete. LightGBM is the right choice. Now let's move forward and build the 9 new features.</p>
