Current gap:  Rate limits by IP → VPN rotation bypasses it
Fix:          Add second rate limit key by card_id
              rate:card:{card_id} → 3 attempts per hour</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Interview value: "I identified the IP-rotation gap myself 
                  during testing and closed it"
Time: 2 hours
