<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Also check if it's in the system tray — look at the bottom right of your screen near the clock, click the <strong>^</strong> arrow to show hidden icons.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Alternative — Run Prometheus + Grafana Without Docker</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Since Docker is having issues, we can run them directly as Windows executables. No Docker needed!</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Prometheus (standalone):</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://prometheus.io/download/">https://prometheus.io/download/</a></strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Download <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">prometheus-x.x.x.windows-amd64.zip</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Extract to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">D:\prometheus</code></li>
