<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">This starts Docker Desktop and waits 30 seconds before checking.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">While Waiting — Let's Skip Docker for Now</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Prometheus and Grafana work perfectly without Docker too. Let's download them directly:</p>
