<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">SHAP correctly identifies V14 as the strongest signal! The decision is APPROVE because the combined score (0.0013) is well below threshold — the V-features in this test transaction don't fully match the fraud pattern despite V14 being negative.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">The 1094ms latency is because SHAP initializes on first call — subsequent calls will be ~10ms.</p>
