<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Now V14 = -5.23 gives the ML model a real fraud signal, geo adds 0.75, and the combined score will likely BLOCK.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">In Production</h3>
