<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Now let's connect it to Prometheus. But first we need Prometheus running.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 1 — Find and Start Prometheus</h3>
