s="group relative relative pb-3" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><h2 class="sr-only select-none">Claude responded: Prometheus is running!</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Prometheus is running! The "Failed to fetch" warning is just a browser CORS issue — not a real problem.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 2 — Add Prometheus as Grafana Data Source</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="http://localhost:3000/">http://localhost:3000</a></strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>☰ (hamburger menu)</strong> → <strong>Connections</strong> → <strong>Data sources</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Add data source"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Select <strong>Prometheus</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">In the URL field enter: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">http://localhost:9090</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Scroll down → click <strong>"Save &amp; test"</strong></li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">You should see <strong>"Data source is working"</strong> ✅</p>
