<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Add First Panel — Requests per Second</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">In the query section at the bottom:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Select metric"</strong> dropdown</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Type <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">fraud_requests_total</code> and select it</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Run queries"</strong></li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">If no data shows, manually type in the <strong>Expression</strong> field:</p>
