<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">1. Change Time Range</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Top right corner → click <strong>"Last 6 hours"</strong> → select <strong>"Last 5 minutes"</strong></p>
