<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Now change time range to <strong>Last 5 minutes</strong> to see live data. Click the time picker (top right shows "Last 6 hours") → select <strong>"Last 5 minutes"</strong> → click <strong>Refresh</strong>.</p>
