<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><em>"On my 8-core laptop with 16GB RAM, the system handles 12,849 req/min with zero errors at P95 latency under 50ms. Most requests are correctly rate-limited — that's the system working as designed. For Razorpay's scale of 100M transactions per day (~70,000/min peak), we'd horizontally scale to 10 GCP Cloud Run instances with a Redis Cluster for shared rate limiting state across workers."</em></p>
