</span><span>    8. Prometheus metrics recording
</span><span>    9. Webhook alert check
</span><span>
</span><span>  Each of these adds microseconds to milliseconds.
</span><span>  Total overhead: ~5-10ms per request.
</span><span>  That's why RPM dropped slightly.</span></code></pre></div></div>
