<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Interview Answer</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><em>"Raw RPM decreased from 18,327 to 14,921 after adding 9 production features — SHAP explanations, geo scoring, velocity decay, A/B testing, heatmap, replay, Prometheus metrics, webhook alerts, and Redis rate limiting. Each adds overhead. The important metric is P95 latency at 100 concurrent threads — it went from 254ms to 43ms after scaling to 8 workers. The system is doing significantly more work per request while maintaining lower tail latency."</em></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
