</span><span>  SHAP:    5-10ms per request → slowest operation</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Level 1 — 100K RPM (Fix Code)</h3>
