</span></span><span>  Request → rate limit → ML → graph → geo → response
</span><span>  Total: 20-40ms per request
</span><span>  Bottleneck: everything sequential
</span><span>
</span><span>With Kafka (async):
</span><span>  Request → rate limit → queue → 200 OK (instant!)
</span><span>  Background: ML + graph + geo → store result
</span><span>  Client polls for result
</span><span>  
</span><span>  API latency: &lt;5ms (just rate limit check)
</span><span>  ML throughput: unlimited workers
</span><span>  RPM: limited only by rate limit layer</span></code></pre></div></div>
