</span></span><span>
</span><span>Layer 1: Edge CDN (Cloudflare)
</span><span>  → IP reputation, basic rules
</span><span>  → blocks 80% of traffic before your API
</span><span>
</span><span>Layer 2: API Gateway (Kong/AWS API GW)
</span><span>  → auth, rate limiting, routing
</span><span>  → 10M+ RPM capacity
</span><span>
</span><span>Layer 3: ML Serving (TensorFlow Serving / Triton)
</span><span>  → GPU-accelerated inference
</span><span>  → 1M+ predictions/second
</span><span>
</span><span>Layer 4: Stream Processing (Kafka + Flink)
</span><span>  → real-time graph updates
</span><span>  → fraud ring detection at scale
</span><span>
</span><span>Layer 5: Storage
</span><span>  → Redis Cluster (rate limiting)
</span><span>  → Neo4j (fraud graphs)
</span><span>  → Cassandra (transaction history)
</span><span>  → ClickHouse (analytics)</span></code></pre></div></div>
