<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">What is SHAP?</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">SHAP = <strong>SHapley Additive exPlanations</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">It answers the question: <strong>"WHY did the model make this decision?"</strong></p>
