</span></span><span>   Banks are legally required to explain
</span><span>   why a transaction was blocked (RBI guidelines)
</span><span>   "Sorry, algorithm said no" is not acceptable
</span><span>
</span><span>2. Fraud analyst tool
</span><span>   Human reviewer sees exactly which features
</span><span>   triggered the block → faster investigation
</span><span>
</span><span>3. Interview value
</span><span>   Shows you understand ML beyond accuracy numbers
</span><span>   "I can explain every decision the model makes"
</span><span>
</span><span>4. Customer service
</span><span>   When legitimate customer is blocked,
</span><span>   support team can see exactly why
</span><span>   and manually override if needed</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
