</span></span><span>  Every request → SHAP runs → 5-10ms overhead
</span><span>  
</span><span>  APPROVE → SHAP runs → "✅ low risk" (nobody cares why)
</span><span>  BLOCK   → SHAP runs → "🚫 V14 is suspicious" (useful!)
</span><span>  
</span><span>Optimized (fast):
</span><span>  APPROVE → skip SHAP → "✅ APPROVED" (saves 5-10ms)
</span><span>  BLOCK   → SHAP runs → "🚫 V14 is suspicious" (still useful!)</span></code></pre></div></div>
