</span></span><span>  ~4.9M APPROVE (98%)  → no explanation needed
</span><span>  ~100K BLOCK (2%)     → explanation critical
</span><span>
</span><span>Running SHAP on ALL 5M = waste of 5M × 10ms = 14 hours of compute/day
</span><span>Running SHAP on 100K BLOCK only = 100K × 10ms = 17 minutes of compute/day
</span><span>
</span><span>Same quality, 50x less compute, 50x more throughput</span></code></pre></div></div>
