</span></span><span>git push</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Your FAANG Interview Answer</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><em>"Starting from 18,327 RPM baseline, I implemented three architectural changes: conditional SHAP execution saved 5-10ms on approved transactions, async endpoints with in-memory queue removed ML blocking and reached 86,286 RPM, and Redis Streams decoupled the API from ML inference reaching 100,437 RPM on a single 8-core laptop. Projected to GCP Cloud Run at 100 instances that's 3.95 million RPM — sufficient for Razorpay's peak traffic of ~70,000 RPM with 56x headroom."</em></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
