<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">🌱 Why This Project Was Built</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">You're a 2026 B.E. ISE graduate from Siddaganga Institute of Technology targeting SDE 1 at Google, Razorpay, Stripe, and Flipkart. Most graduates apply with todo apps. You needed something production-grade.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">We chose <strong>AI Credit Card Fraud Detection</strong> because:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Directly relevant to fintech companies</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Combines ML + backend + distributed systems</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Real business stakes</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Deployable as a live demo</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
