</span></span><span>  Worker 1: user has 4 requests → 1 more allowed
</span><span>  Worker 2: user has 0 requests → 5 more allowed!
</span><span>  = Attacker gets 40 requests across 8 workers
</span><span>
</span><span>Redis is shared → everyone sees same counter ✅</span></code></pre></div></div>
