<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">🔒 Phase 9 — Graph Hardening</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Gap 1 found:</strong> Edges never expired → stale rings persist</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Fix:</strong> 1-hour TTL on all edges + background cleanup thread</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Gap 2 found:</strong> IP rotation bypass — each card uses different IP</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Fix — merchant ring detection:</strong></p>
