<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">creditcard.csv was 143MB → exceeded GitHub's 100MB limit</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Used <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">git filter-branch</code> to rewrite history</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Large prometheus data files → same problem</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Eventually cleaned with <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">git filter-branch --index-filter</code></li>
</ul>
