</span></span><span>  fraud_graph:ip:{ip}:cards     ← cards sharing this IP
</span><span>  fraud_graph:merchant:{m}:cards ← cards at this merchant
</span><span>  fraud_graph:card:{c}:merchants ← merchants for this card
</span><span>
</span><span>TTL = 3600 seconds (automatic expiry — no cleanup thread needed)
</span><span>All workers read from same Redis keys → shared state ✅</span></code></pre></div></div>
