<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Step 2 — Set up Microsoft Learn profile:</strong>
Go to 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://aiskillsnavigator.microsoft.com/">https://aiskillsnavigator.microsoft.com</a></strong>
