<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 1 — Create Azure Free Account</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Go to 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://azure.microsoft.com/free">https://azure.microsoft.com/free</a></strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Click <strong>"Start free"</strong> — you get:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">$200 credits for 30 days</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Azure OpenAI access</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Azure AI Foundry access</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>While signing up, tell me:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Do you have a Microsoft account already?</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Which track did you choose? (Creative Apps / Reasoning Agents / Enterprise Agents)</li>
</ul>
