]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal">Good question — let me explain clearly before we build.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">What We're Building</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>FraudShield AI</strong> — an autonomous agent system that doesn't just detect fraud, but <strong>investigates, explains, and acts on it automatically</strong>.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
