</span></span><span>  Transaction comes in
</span><span>  → ML scores it
</span><span>  → BLOCK/APPROVE
</span><span>  → Done.
</span><span>  
</span><span>  Human analyst still needs to:
</span><span>    - Figure out WHY it was blocked
</span><span>    - Investigate the pattern
</span><span>    - Write a report
</span><span>    - Send alert to team
</span><span>    - Decide next action
</span><span>  
</span><span>FraudShield AI Agent system:
</span><span>  Transaction comes in
</span><span>  → Agent detects fraud
</span><span>  → Agent investigates automatically
</span><span>  → Agent writes explanation in plain English
</span><span>  → Agent sends alert to team
</span><span>  → Agent suggests next action
</span><span>  → Done. Zero human effort needed.</span></code></pre></div></div>
