</span></span><span>  Job: "Is this fraud?"
</span><span>  Uses: Your LightGBM model + graph detection
</span><span>  Input: Transaction details
</span><span>  Output: BLOCK/APPROVE + risk score
</span><span>
</span><span>Agent 2 — Investigation Agent  
</span><span>  Job: "Why is this fraud?"
</span><span>  Uses: SHAP values + geo risk + velocity
</span><span>  Input: Blocked transaction
</span><span>  Output: List of fraud signals with explanations
</span><span>
</span><span>Agent 3 — Explanation Agent
</span><span>  Job: "Explain this to a human"
</span><span>  Uses: GPT-4o (Azure OpenAI)
</span><span>  Input: Fraud signals
</span><span>  Output: Plain English report
</span><span>  Example: "This transaction was blocked because a ₹149
</span><span>            purchase was made at 2am from Romania via VPN.
</span><span>            The same merchant was hit by 4 different cards
</span><span>            in the last hour — a coordinated attack pattern."
</span><span>
</span><span>Agent 4 — Alert Agent
</span><span>  Job: "Tell the right people"
</span><span>  Uses: Your existing webhook alerts
</span><span>  Input: Fraud report
</span><span>  Output: Slack message + audit log</span></code></pre></div></div>
