</span></span><span>  Transaction → Detection → Investigation 
</span><span>  → Explanation → Alert → Done
</span><span>  (no reasoning, just sequence)
</span><span>
</span><span>Reasoning Agent (what judges want):
</span><span>  Transaction → Agent thinks → decides to call
</span><span>  detection tool → sees result → decides to
</span><span>  investigate deeper → calls investigation tool
</span><span>  → reasons about pattern → decides explanation
</span><span>  needed → calls GPT-4o → reasons about severity
</span><span>  → decides alert needed → sends alert
</span><span>  (agent DECIDES each step)</span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">How to Fix This — 2 Options</h3>
