<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">What To Do RIGHT NOW</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Join Discord: 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://aka.ms/agentsleague/discord">https://aka.ms/agentsleague/discord</a></strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Check your Microsoft Learn profile username at 👉 <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://learn.microsoft.com/">https://learn.microsoft.com</a></strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal"><strong>Step 3:</strong> Tell me — did you complete registration on the hackathon platform after getting the confirmation email? The rules say you need to activate your profile on the Contest Website.</p>
